WARNING — WHAT THIS SOFTWARE CAN DO
-----------------------------------
This is a Mail Connector (MCP server) for Renater partage academic mailboxes.
When the destructive/write tools are enabled (i.e. `readonly: false`), it can
SEND email, delete mail, move messages, rename/delete folders and change
read flags on your behalf, authenticated with your Renater SSO password.

If you use this software, you are solely responsible for the actions taken
with your account, including any messages sent, deleted or modified. Use it
carefully, restrict it to trusted AI agents, consider enabling
`readonly: true` if you only need to read mail, and keep your password
protected. See the README for details on the read-only mode.

